<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Gas Tomza | Seleccionar departamento</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; }
    body { min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; color: #182230; background: #f3f6f8; font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif; }
    .portal { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 60px; }
    .portal-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 56px; }
    .portal-head img { width: 132px; height: 58px; object-fit: contain; background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 5px; }
    .portal-head strong { display: block; font-size: 20px; }
    .portal-head span { color: #667085; font-size: 14px; }
    h1 { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 42px); font-weight: 750; }
    .intro { color: #667085; margin: 0 0 28px; }
    .departments { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
    .department { display: flex; min-height: 142px; flex-direction: column; padding: 20px; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #dce3e8; border-radius: 8px; transition: border-color .15s, box-shadow .15s, transform .15s; }
    .department:hover { color: inherit; border-color: #14826d; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px #172b3a12; transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .department-icon { color: #087f68; font-size: 22px; }
    .department strong { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 17px; }
    .department small { margin-top: 5px; color: #667085; line-height: 1.4; }
    .portal-foot { margin-top: 30px; color: #667085; font-size: 13px; }
    @media(max-width: 760px) { .departments { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .portal-head { margin-bottom: 38px; } }
    @media(max-width: 480px) { .portal { padding: 28px 16px 40px; } .departments { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="portal">
    <header class="portal-head">
      <img src="/img/logo_tomza.jpg" alt="Gas Tomza">
      <div><strong>Sistema Empresarial</strong><span>Acceso interno Gas Tomza</span></div>
    </header>
    <h1>¿A qué departamento desea ingresar?</h1>
    <p class="intro">Seleccione el área para continuar al inicio de sesión. El acceso se valida según los permisos de su cuenta.</p>
    <nav class="departments" aria-label="Departamentos">
      <% departamentos.forEach(departamento => { %>
        <a class="department" href="/login?departamento=<%= encodeURIComponent(departamento.key) %>&amp;next=<%= encodeURIComponent(next || '') %>">
          <i class="bi <%= departamento.icono %> department-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <strong><%= departamento.nombre %></strong>
          <small><%= departamento.descripcion %></small>
        </a>
      <% }) %>
    </nav>
    <p class="portal-foot">La selección organiza el ingreso; no sustituye las autorizaciones asignadas por administración.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
